

| Attack / Detection Rule        | MITRE ATT&CK ID | Description |
|--------------------------------|----------------|-------------|
| Brute Force                     | T1110          | Multiple failed authentication attempts indicating password guessing. |
| Credential Dumping              | T1003          | Extraction of stored credentials from system memory or files. |
| Process Injection               | T1055          | Injection of malicious code into legitimate processes to evade detection. |
| File Integrity Monitoring Alert | T1070.001      | Unauthorized modification or deletion of critical system files. |
| Suspicious Network Connection   | T1043          | Connections to known C2 servers or unusual external IPs. |
| DLL Side-Loading                | T1073          | Loading malicious DLLs into trusted processes. |
| Ransomware Behavior             | T1486          | File encryption activity indicative of ransomware. |
| Lateral Movement (SMB)          | T1021.002      | Using SMB protocol to move between Windows systems. |
